    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Ah, Doctor! Good morning."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "So you made it, Dr. {@nickname}."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Doctor, are you feeling better now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "You looked like you were still in pain and and couldn't move around well yesterday."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "I've made a complete recovery. How about you?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I'm perfectly fine and full of energy today!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "After all, we still have other missions to take care of..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "So the sooner we can start preparing, the better. Doctor, you should get used to having to shift gears quickly here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Doctor,"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Even though we sustained heavy losses in Chernobog, we gained a lot of information about Reunion and, more importantly, got you out alive."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Based on the negotiations we had yesterday, the closest nomadic city to us, Lungmen, has offered us a cooperation pact and agreed to exchange information with us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "We have some evidence that Reunion might be targeting Lungmen next."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "We'll have to wait for Dr. Kal'tsit's permission first before we can get the rest of the information. She's still stationed within Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Lungmen has granted us permission to temporary camp near the city. They've also agreed to compensate a portion of our losses and expenditures during the operation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "In exchanges, Rhodes Island is expected to help defend the city's outskirts."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "But the reason why I called for you so early is..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Let me explain it, Amiya."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Last night, we discovered another wave of Chernobog survivors making their way towards Lungmen. They're expected to get there in the afternoon."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "We'll be expected to safeguard the outskirts of District 5 just like the last few days. Only this time, there might be more Reunion members mixed into the group."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Because the situation is a bit different, we'll need to discuss some new tactics with you before beginning the operation."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Anyway, Doctor, there's a lot to get through today, so..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Let's do our best!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "In any case..."
    },
